# The repository root is a Python project and its .gitignore excludes `*.ts`
# and `lib/`. This is a TypeScript app, so re-include both here — without
# these two lines most of the source silently fails to commit.
!*.ts
!lib/

# Regenerated by `next dev`/`next build`; must come after the !*.ts negation.
next-env.d.ts
